{
  "$schema": "https://aka.ms/codetour-schema",
  "title": "04 - Sending a message",
  "description": "Follow one message from the moment you press Enter until it reaches the agent, and see how the answer streams back.",
  "nextTour": "05 - The API inside Next.js",
